        ],
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045150/extras/b6349af3e965951219f7d412f087c409.avif?t=1760458558\" width=184 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原作：<i>上海</i>アリス幻樂団</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >東方同人二次创作</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cute-style desktop pet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Youmu Konpaku, the gardener of Hakugyokurou, <strong>your job is to feed Lady Yuyuko various files</strong>! In most cases she isn’t picky~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At heart this is a file-shredder wearing the skin of a desktop pet. Of course, the “food” you feed her will be sent to the Recycle Bin rather than vanishing outright — except in some cases...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s fine if you don’t feed Yuyuko for a long time, but she’ll feel a little sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also interactive behaviors, like picking her up and shaking her, or feeding files that contain certain keywords — go try it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding concept by: IWasAllen</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045150/extras/b6349af3e965951219f7d412f087c409.avif?t=1760458558\" width=184 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >原作：<i>上海</i>アリス幻樂団</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >東方同人二次创作</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A cute-style desktop pet.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Youmu Konpaku, the gardener of Hakugyokurou, <strong>your job is to feed Lady Yuyuko various files</strong>! In most cases she isn’t picky~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At heart this is a file-shredder wearing the skin of a desktop pet. Of course, the “food” you feed her will be sent to the Recycle Bin rather than vanishing outright — except in some cases...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s fine if you don’t feed Yuyuko for a long time, but she’ll feel a little sad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also interactive behaviors, like picking her up and shaking her, or feeding files that contain certain keywords — go try it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feeding concept by: IWasAllen</strong></p>",
